    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello All,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m reporting detection probability from my gdistsamp models in a manuscript and would like to include some measure of error for the detection estimate from getP() and I&#39;m wondering what the simplest way to do that is. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Auriel</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
